    ('national-pacific-rim-national-park-reserve', 'Pacific Rim National Park Reserve', 'national', 49.060406, -125.722799, 'West Coast', 'On Vancouver Island’s west coast, Pacific Rim brings together three distinct areas: sandy beaches and rainforest at Long Beach, boat-access islands in Barkley Sound, and the backcountry West Coast Trail. The reserve protects coastal forest and nearshore marine habitat.', 'https://parks.canada.ca/pn-np/bc/pacificrim', 'Parks Canada', NULL, NULL),
