    ('provincial-artlish-caves-park', 'Artlish Caves Park', 'provincial', 50.139233, -126.905802, 'North Island', 'Artlish Caves protects nationally significant limestone karst, with large cave entrances, an underground river and old-growth forest. The area is remote and ecologically sensitive; BC Parks says caving is not recommended until a management plan is in place.', 'https://catalogue.data.gov.bc.ca/dataset/parks-ecological-reserves-and-protected-areas', 'BC Parks / DataBC — TANTALIS protected areas', '472', NULL),
