    ('provincial-saysutshun-newcastle-island-marine-park', 'Saysutshun (Newcastle Island Marine) Park', 'provincial', 49.188512, -123.933753, 'Gulf Islands', 'A short passenger-ferry ride from Nanaimo reaches Saysutshun, an island park with steep sandstone shores and a long history of cultural and recreational use. Visitors can explore its paths and beaches, camp, and learn about the island''s stories.', 'https://catalogue.data.gov.bc.ca/dataset/parks-ecological-reserves-and-protected-areas', 'BC Parks / DataBC — TANTALIS protected areas', '921', NULL),
